      "role": "user",
      "content": "That point about the \"contradictory paradox\" of championing freedom while concentrating power is a really strong hook. Can you dig into that more? Specifically, how does their rhetoric about \"personal responsibility\" actually serve to protect those structural barriers you mentioned, rather than just being an innocent philosophical stance?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
